      "text": [
        " زُرَارَةُ سَمِعْتُ أَبَا جَعْفَرٍ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ يَقُولُ: «اَلدُّعَاءُ بَعْدَ اَلْفَرِيضَةِ أَفْضَلُ مِنَ اَلصَّلاَةِ تَنَفُّلاً."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.963 - Zurarah reported that he heard Abu Ja'far (as) say:\n\"Supplication after the obligatory prayer is better than offering a voluntary prayer.\"\nAnd thus, this has been the practice."
        ]
      }
